<!-- Hero -->
<div class="hero">
  <img src="cid:kids-hero" alt="KCF children" width="600" />
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h1 class="title">Thank You for Beginning This Journey</h1>

  <div class="letter">
    <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>We are deeply grateful that you've chosen to register your interest in sponsoring a child through Kwizera. Your compassion and generosity are the first steps toward transforming a young life in Kigali.</p>
    <p>Every child deserves hope, education, and the chance to dream. Today, you've made that possible for one special child who will soon become your little bestie.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Story card -->
  <div class="story-card">
    <h2>Our Story: Born from Hope During COVID-19</h2>
    <p>Kwizera Charity Foundation was founded during the COVID-19 pandemic when our founder, Eric, witnessed firsthand how vulnerable children in Kigali were being left behind. Schools closed, families struggled, and dreams were fading.</p>
    <p>But we believed in a different future. "Kwizera" means "hope" in Kinyarwanda, and that's exactly what we've been building—one child, one sponsor, one meaningful relationship at a time.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <h2 class="section-title">What Happens Next</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>We Review Your Interest</h3>
        <p>Our team carefully considers your preferences and commitment to find the perfect match.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>We Find Your Child Match</h3>
        <p>We identify a child whose story, dreams, and needs align with your sponsorship journey.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>We Prepare Your Sponsorship Pack</h3>
        <p>You'll receive a comprehensive digital pack with all the details about your new little bestie.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">4</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>You Meet Your Sponsored Child</h3>
        <p>The most exciting moment—seeing their smile and learning about their dreams for the first time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quote -->
  <div class="quote">
    <blockquote>"Every child we support reminds me why we started this journey. It's not about charity—it's about building genuine, life-changing relationships that give our children the tools to build their own futures."</blockquote>
    <div class="quote-author">
      <div class="avatar">E</div>
      <div>
        <div class="name">Eric</div>
        <div class="role">Founder, Kwizera Charity Foundation</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cta-wrap">
    <a href="https://kwizeracharityfoundation.org" class="cta">Learn More About Our Mission</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Signoff -->
  <p class="signoff">
    With gratitude and hope,<br>
    <span class="team">The Kwizera Team</span>
  </p>
</div>
